.bsMuted2)
      }
      .padding(10)
      .background(Color.bsSurface2)
      .clipShape(RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 10, style: .continuous))
    }
    .buttonStyle(.plain)
  }

'''
dashboard = dashboard.replace(marker, workflow_card + marker, 1)
write('Sources/Blackstock/Views/CreatorOS1000View.swift', dashboard)

# 4) Research and Ideas workspaces: derived entirely from live/store data, no fake market data.
workspace = r'''import SwiftUI

private enum ResearchReachBand: String, CaseIterable, Identifiable {
  case all = "Alle Reichweiten"
  case emerging = "Long Tail"
  case niche = "Nische"
  case broad = "Breit"
  var id: String { rawValue }

  func matches(_ views: Int?) -> Bool {
    guard self != .all else { return true }
    let value = views ?? 0
    switch self {
    case .all: return true
    case .emerging: return value < 25_000
    case .niche: return value >= 25_000 && value < 250_000
    case .broad: return value >= 250_000
    }
  }
}

private struct ResearchCluster: Identifiable {
  var id: String { topic.lowercased() }
  let topic: String
  let videos: [Chance]

  var creators: Int { Set(videos.compactMap(\.youtubeChannelTitle)).count }
  var medianViews: Int {
    let values = videos.compactMap(\.youtubeViews).sorted()
    guard !values.isEmpty else { return 0 }
    return values[values.count / 2]
  }
  var shorts: Int { videos.filter { ($0.youtubeDurationSeconds ?? 9_999) < 60 }.count }
}

struct ResearchWorkspaceView: View {
  @EnvironmentObject private var store: AppStore
  @State private var selectedChannelID: UUID?
  @State private var reachBand: ResearchReachBand = .all
  @State private var query = ""

  private var scoped: [Chance] {
    let needle = query.trimmingCharacters(in: .whitespacesAndNewlines)
      .folding(options: [.caseInsensitive, .diacriticInsensitive], locale: .current)
    return store.chancen.filter { chance in
      guard chance.youtubeVideoID != nil else { return false }
      guard reachBand.matches(chance.youtubeViews) else { return false }
      if let selectedChannelID, let assigned = chance.empfohlenerKanalID, assigned != selectedChannelID { return false }
      guard !needle.isEmpty else { return true }
      let haystack = "\(chance.titel) \(chance.thema) \(chance.youtubeChannelTitle ?? "")"
        .folding(options: [.caseInsensitive, .diacriticInsensitive], locale: .current)
      return haystack.contains(needle)
    }
  }

  private var saved: [Chance] {
    scoped.filter { chance in
      chance.youtubeVideoID.map(store.v100State.shortlistedVideoIDs.contains) ?? false
    }
  }

  private var clusters: [ResearchCluster] {
    Dictionary(grouping: scoped, by: { $0.thema.trimmingCharacters(in: .whitespacesAndNewlines) })
      .map { ResearchCluster(topic: $0.key.isEmpty ? "Unkategorisiert" : $0.key, videos: $0.value) }
      .sorted { lhs, rhs in
        if lhs.videos.count == rhs.videos.count { return lhs.medianViews > rhs.medianViews }
        return lhs.videos.count > rhs.videos.count
      }
  }

  var body: some View {
    ScrollView {
      VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 16) {
        PageHeader(
          titel: "Recherche",
          untertitel: "Marktstruktur, Nischen und konkrete YouTube-Referenzen aus den tatsächlich geladenen Daten.",
          trailing: AnyView(channelPicker))
        controls
        marketOverview
        evidenceLibrary
      }
      .padding(24)
    }
    .onAppear {
      if selectedChannelID == nil { selectedChannelID = store.v12ActiveChannelID ?? store.liveKanaele.first?.id }
    }
  }

  private var channelPicker: some View {
    Picker("Kanal", selection: $selectedChannelID) {
      Text("Alle Kanäle").tag(UUID?.none)
      ForEach(store.liveKanaele) { channel in Text(channel.name).tag(Optional(channel.id)) }
    }
    .frame(width: 220)
  }

  private var controls: some View {
    HStack(spacing: 10) {
      HStack(spacing: 8) {
        Image(systemName: "magnifyingglass").foregroundStyle(Color.bsMuted)
        TextField("Thema, Video oder Creator durchsuchen", text: $query).textFieldStyle(.plain)
      }
      .padding(.horizontal, 11).frame(maxWidth: .infinity, minHeight: 36)
      .background(Color.bsSurface2).clipShape(RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 9))

      Picker("Reichweite", selection: $reachBand) {
        ForEach(ResearchReachBand.allCases) { band in Text(band.rawValue).tag(band) }
      }
      .frame(width: 170)

      Button { store.ausgewaehltesZiel = .chancen } label: {
        Label("Mehr entdecken", systemImage: "safari.fill")
      }
      .buttonStyle(.borderedProminent).tint(Color.bsRed).foregroundStyle(.white)
    }
  }

  private var marketOverview: some View {
    VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 12) {
      HStack {
        AbschnittTitel(
          titel: "Nischen-Radar",
          untertitel: "Keine erfundenen Marktgrößen: Anzahl geladener Videos, Creator und Median-Views je Themencluster.")
        Spacer()
        Text("\(scoped.count) Referenzen")
          .font(.system(size: 9.5, weight: .semibold)).foregroundStyle(Color.bsMuted)
      }
      if clusters.isEmpty {
        Text("Noch keine passenden Referenzen. Öffne Entdecken und lade weitere Themenblöcke